From 4bbb6f2ce5287560cd3bb20152593dafcd228891 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matthew <matthewhale@live.com.au>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 22:27:01 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 35/59] XvT engine wash sound

OpenXvT fsfx_UpdateFlightSfx: while the player is in engine wash, loop
sd-lp-1.wav (Interdictor, Victory and Imperial Star Destroyers) or
cal-flyb.wav (other ships), louder with the wash strength. collide.c keeps
XvT's strongest-source/strength per wash update; engine_wash_sound.c plays
the two WAVs (resources/xvt_engine_wash, copied from XvT by package_xw.sh)
as iMUSE sound IDs 400-401, served by Dos94_gamesnd_GetSoundAddr outside
X-Wing's bank slots. WAV-to-VOC loading is shared with the weapon sounds.
